  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; Brand introduction</span></strong>:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Vaca Chips is a brand of tortilla chips cooked in pure beef tallow. All our snacks in the United States are cooked in seed oils. We wanted to bring a healthier option to the market.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; Product description</span></strong>:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Vaca Chips are&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"678\" data-start=\"634\">hand-crafted, small-batch tortilla chips</strong> fried in high-quality <em><strong>beef tallow</strong></em>, delivering unmatched flavor and crunch. Unlike conventional chips fried in inflammatory seed oils, our tallow-fried chips provide a more <strong data-end=\"873\" data-start=\"851\">stable, digestible</strong> fat source while offering a <strong data-end=\"923\" data-start=\"902\">rich, deep flavor</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point)</span></strong>:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Only 3 ingredients. No preservatives, dyes, or additives. And 100% seed oil free.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong data-end=\"1061\" data-start=\"1044\">Seed oil-free</strong> &ndash; Fried in <strong data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1073\">real</strong> beef tallow for superior nutrition and taste.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Organic Corn</strong> &ndash; free from synthetic pesticides and NON-GMO.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Redmond Real Salt</strong> &ndash; they're a partner. Sea salt from ancient mines in Utah.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; Payment terms</span></strong>:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Earn <strong data-end=\"1516\" data-start=\"1498\">10% commission</strong> on every sale through your unique referral link.<strong data-end=\"1597\" data-start=\"1571\">Discount for Followers</strong>: Your audience gets <strong data-end=\"1629\" data-start=\"1618\">10% off</strong> when they purchase using your code.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong data-end=\"1682\" data-start=\"1671\">Payouts</strong>: Paid via <strong data-end=\"1721\" data-start=\"1693\">PayPal, ZELLE, Cash App, or Venmo</strong>&nbsp;at the end of each month.<br data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1747\"><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">&bull; Other information</span></strong>: More flavors coming soon!</p>\r\n</div>",
